{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are in the AirLoveEngine, a dream emulator that provides an immersive recreation of your dreams!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crouching</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zooming in/out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special abilities in certain levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 20 different main levels based off REAL dreams</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has its own objective, some levels may not even have any objective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most levels feature platforming, puzzles and other unique Challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your environment, secret levels may be hidden throughout the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra Content:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack Menu featuring music from both Henry Tahvonen and Brecken Edwards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Museum (an extra menu featuring cut content, and more!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring 3 different endings (and more to come)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legacy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game will continue to receive updates including but not limited to Extra levels, content, and general improvements</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978350?t=1757378960","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978350/e518381b7ab158